<title>UK: Dated Brent sells at lower Nov parity, date kept.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent sells at lower Nov parity, date kept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Sea benchmark Brent crude traded 10 cents down on Thursday in a deal at November paper parity for an October 24-26 cargo, dealers said.</p>
<p>The one Brent cargo nominated loading dates on Thursday was kept by its equity holder Esso, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
